# Device patch series, applied after arch/soc/os in the order listed (format 2).
#
# native-smp-secondary.patch: the machine configuration this port builds for is BCM2837, whose
# board_config.h tops out at four CPUs, and kona reports the core number in MPIDR Affinity1 while
# XNU's early start path reads Affinity0 when HAS_CLUSTER is off. Without this the eight-core tree
# trips the topology asserts in ml_parse_cpu_topology (cold blocks at 1061/1099/1103/1174), which is
# why every image so far carried cpus=1. Taken from the SM8550 SoC package, where the same machine
# configuration is used; it is a device-level override here because our SoC package carries no patches.
native-smp-secondary.patch
